{{#if springBoot}}
## Backend — Spring Boot {{versions.springBoot}}

- **Java 21** — records, pattern matching, sealed classes, virtual threads
- **Architecture:** `com.<groupId>.<feature>.{domain,application,infrastructure}`{{#if flyway}}
- **DB:** PostgreSQL, Flyway migrations in `backend/src/main/resources/db/migration/`{{/if}}

### Commands
```bash
cd backend
./mvnw spring-boot:run   # Start dev server
./mvnw test              # Run tests
./mvnw package           # Build jar
```
{{/if}}
{{#if fastapi}}
## Backend — FastAPI (Python 3.12)

- **Architecture:** `app/routers/`, `app/config.py`, `tests/`
- **Conventions:** Pydantic models, async endpoints, dependency injection

### Commands
```bash
cd backend
.venv/bin/uvicorn app.main:app --reload   # Start dev server
.venv/bin/pytest tests/ -v                # Run tests
.venv/bin/ruff check .                    # Lint
```
{{/if}}
{{#if laravel}}
## Backend — Laravel {{versions.laravel}} (PHP 8.3+)

- **Architecture:** `app/Http/Controllers/`, `app/Models/`, `app/Services/`, `database/migrations/`
- **Conventions:** Form Requests for validation, API Resources for serialization, Eloquent over raw SQL

### Commands
```bash
cd backend
php artisan serve        # Start dev server
php artisan test         # Run tests (Pest/PHPUnit)
php artisan migrate      # Run DB migrations
./vendor/bin/pint        # Format / lint
```
{{/if}}
{{#if nextjs}}
## Backend — Next.js {{versions.next}} (App Router)

- **Architecture:** `app/` (routes + server components), `app/api/` (route handlers), `lib/`, `components/`
- **Conventions:** Server components by default, `"use client"` only when needed{{#if prisma}}, Prisma for DB access{{/if}}
- **Auth:** {{#if auth}}NextAuth {{versions.nextAuth}}{{else}}None{{/if}}

### Commands
```bash
npm run dev      # Start dev server (port 3000)
npm run build    # Production build
npm run lint     # ESLint{{#if prisma}}
npx prisma migrate dev    # Run DB migrations
npx prisma studio         # Open DB GUI{{/if}}
```
{{/if}}
{{#if angular}}
## Frontend — Angular {{versions.angular}}

- **Architecture:** Standalone components, signals, OnPush
- **UI:** PrimeNG {{versions.primeng}}, theme Aura, PrimeFlex{{#if ngrx}}
- **State:** NgRx SignalStore{{/if}}

### Commands
```bash
cd frontend
ng serve         # Start dev server (port 4200)
ng test          # Run unit tests
ng build         # Production build
```
{{/if}}
{{#if reactVite}}
## Frontend — React {{versions.react}} (Vite + Tailwind)

- **Architecture:** `src/router/`, `src/hooks/`, `src/components/`, `src/lib/`
- **Conventions:** Functional components, hooks-first, React Router v7
- **CSS:** Tailwind CSS v4

### Commands
```bash
cd frontend
npm run dev      # Start dev server (port 4200)
npm run build    # Production build
npm run lint     # TypeScript check
```
{{/if}}
{{#if vue}}
## Frontend — Vue {{versions.vue}} (Composition API + Vite)

- **Architecture:** `src/composables/`, `src/stores/` (Pinia), `src/components/`, `src/router/`
- **Conventions:** Composition API with `<script setup>`, Pinia for state, Vue Router {{versions.vueRouter}}

### Commands
```bash
cd frontend
npm run dev      # Start dev server (port 4200)
npm run build    # Production build
npm run lint     # TypeScript check
```
{{/if}}
